            <ArticleTitle>Torsion of an omental lipoma presenting as an emergency.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>130-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Primary omental pathology is rare. A case of torsion of an omental lipoma is reported in a 77-year-old women presenting as an emergency with lower abdominal pain. Abdominal and pelvic CT scan was of value in the pre-operative investigation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
